}

// Gaussian-error GELU via regularized incomplete gamma at a=1/2.
// Mathematical identities: DLMF 7.11.2, 8.7.1 and 8.9.2. Independent implementation.
// Positive-term series below z=1.5; contracted continued fraction above it.
// Double arithmetic preserves negative tails; only the final GELU rounds to Float32.
